# Local Helm/tar packages (e.g. a `helm dependency build` byproduct such as
# helm/argocd/charts/argo-cd-9.3.7.tgz) -- never a committed source artifact.
# The unpacked helm/argocd/charts/argo-cd/ directory is the real vendored
# source and is never matched by these patterns.
